{"ref":"BDB, רִמּוֹן⁴","hw":"רִמּוֹן⁴","html":"† IV. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רִמּוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in <span dir=\"rtl\">סֶלַע הָרִמּוֹן</span> <em>cliff of R.</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:45\" href=\"/Judges.20.45\">Ju 20:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:47\" href=\"/Judges.20.47\">47</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳ רִמּוֹן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:47\" href=\"/Judges.20.47\">47</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:13\" href=\"/Judges.21.13\">21:13</a>; Ρεμμων; = mod. cliff <em>Rammôn</em>, E. from Bethel, BuhlG <sup>100</sup>, cf. GFM <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:45\" href=\"/Judges.20.45\">Ju 20:45</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in S. Judah, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיִן וְר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:32\" href=\"/Joshua.15.32\">Jos 15:32</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַיִן ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:7\" href=\"/Joshua.19.7\">19:7</a> (both P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.32\">1 Ch 4:32</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.10\">Zc 14:10</a>; Ρεμμων[θ], etc.; v. iii. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, עַ֫יִן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_עַ֫יִן\">עַיִן</a> <strong>2</strong>, p. 745, and <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עֵין רִמּוֹן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵין רִמּוֹן\">עֵין רִמּוֹן</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  in Zebulun <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:13\" href=\"/Joshua.19.13\">Jos 19:13</a> (Ρεμμωνα(μ)), = <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמּוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:62\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.62\">1 Ch 6:62</a> (Ρεμμων); + <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:35\" href=\"/Joshua.21.35\">Jos 21:35</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">רִמֹּנָה</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּמְנָה</span>, Di Benn Steuern); mod. <em>Rummâne</em>, c. 6 miles E. of N. from Nazareth (Buhl<sup>G 221</sup>).","next":"BDB, רִמֹּן פָּ֑רֶץ","prev":"BDB, רִמּוֹן³"}